 "note": "S, 13 platforms, open, inward. The middle road runs through a tilt hub on the axis. Firing it tips the hub up toward the top crossing, the next time down toward the bottom one: every line standing on it (either side's) slides out that way; the garrison stays. The crossings are the only other ways across. Mirrored left / right, so both exits sit on the axis and each fire is fair. Survivor ring: the hub, the middle road and the crossings.",
